% Preconditions are fixed scenario assumptions, not inferred from CVSS.
% Apache 2.4.50: CGI enabled and relevant directories not denied.
% FortiOS 7.2.2: vulnerable SSL-VPN service enabled.
% Tomcat 8.5.22: HTTP PUT enabled (DefaultServlet readonly=false).
% Redis Debian bullseye vulnerable package: remote scripting accessible,
% without an additional authentication barrier from the application host.
% Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1: relevant patch absent and NLA disabled.
% M221: programming/management service accessible from the RDP host only.
networkServiceInfo(h1,apache_http,tcp,443,www_data).
networkServiceInfo(h2,fortios_ssl_vpn,tcp,443,system).
networkServiceInfo(h3,tomcat,tcp,8443,tomcat).
